# No frontend secrets or API base URL are required; dashboard API calls use the same-origin Pages proxy.
# Local Vite proxy forwards /api requests to the local Cloudflare Worker.
# Production Pages requires an API_WORKER Service Binding.
# Store any future provider credentials only as Cloudflare Worker secrets, never in this file.

# Cloudflare Pages project settings (not VITE_* and never exposed to the browser):
# - Service binding: API_WORKER -> deployed Worker service jp-bots-6-backend
# - Pages secret: OPERATOR_API_TOKEN -> same secret value as the backend Worker
# Worker secrets are not inherited by Pages Functions; configure the Pages secret separately.
